README…
Programs compile on a CSUG machine which is x86-64 Linux. The files are =  timing.c/plot.py/alice.c/bob.c/LOL.h. This lab was done in cycle 1.

How to Compile and Run Task 2
gcc -O2 -o timing timing.c
taskset -c 2 ./timing
python3 plot.py


How to View Histogram generated by Plot 2
scp amandhar@cycle1.csug.rochester.edu:~/latency_hist.png .

How to Compile and Run Task 3
gcc -O2 -o run_sender   alice.c
gcc -O2 -o run_receiver bob.c
Terminal B ~ taskset -c 2 ./run_receiver
Terminal A ~ taskset -c 4 ./run_sender
